      },
      "lineNbr": 79,
      "author": {
        "id": 1121838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-10-02T20:11:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "discussed offline. We should have a HAL because vendors could override this behavior for a customized kernel.",
