        "id": 1121838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-10-02T20:18:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can remove this documentation then. Indeed the HAL doesn\u0027t have to passthrough these values from kernel.",
      "parentUuid": "4b49c22c_ec33beb6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 77,
